s, interactive 360 media editor and player, synchronous and asynchronous learning environments, assessments, roleplay functions and LMS integration (SCORM and xAPI).\n\nTry our demonstration modules using the following \"Guest Access\" login codes:\nIntroduction to Facilitate: RMV5SR\nTraining module: syYtPy\nEducation module: gxFndq\n\nEmail enquiries@unleashed-vr.com to organise your 28-day free trial.\nFor further details about Facilitate's features, subscription pricing, or our partner program, visit https://www.facilitate.tech/platform.\"", "short_description": "Facilitate is an easy-to-use creation suite that empowers learning designers and SMEs to rapidly design high impact learning experiences with market-leading flexibility and affordability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.facilitate.tech/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unleashed PTY LTD", "support_website_url": "https://portal.facilitate.tech/help", "website_url": "https://www.facilitate.tech/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": ["UTILITY", "SIMULATION", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "671150790734763"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001698_1474858299513777_367346086618467441_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SRZKP0QdvbwQ7kNvwFNpjiP&_nc_oc=AdpAae5iGZVED7dkZ4-D0TLttIRnUbP4-tHk4FTrr0vFIyJ0cfO0L